Package: pbiweave
Type: Package
Title: Declarative Power BI Reports with Embedded Data
Version: 0.3.1
Authors@R: person("Alek", "Rutkowski", email = "alek.rutkowski@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Build portable Power BI projects using a declarative, pipe-friendly
    interface. Compiles native enhanced report definitions, typed import models
    with embedded data, DAX measures, relationships, layouts, themes, and filters.
    Generated projects use documented PBIR reports and TMDL or TMSL models.
    Includes R-first preparation helpers, explicit interaction bindings, and
    compatibility with the original declarative interface. Power BI Desktop
    performs the initial data refresh and final save to a data-bearing PBIX file.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    base64enc,
    data.table,
    digest,
    jsonlite,
    magrittr,
    stats,
    zip
Suggests:
    bit64,
    nycflights13,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
